  cat >"$commands_file" <<EOF
# ADR-0046 hands-on commands — generated for this run (no blanks to fill)

Full prose runbook: finite-brain/docs/runbooks/adr46-hands-on-test.md
Alice's Personal Brain id: $brain_id
Alice's agent container: $alice_container_id
